{
  "title": "Oven-Roasted Tunisian Lentil Tagine",
  "description": "A hearty, satvik-friendly weeknight dish roasted on a cedar plank, featuring the subtle umami of shaoxing wine and a fragrant tadka spice mix.",
  "cuisine": "Tunisian",
